{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S04及S10-S11略多落在是否走错、是否回去的去留判断上，局部把更广泛的尊严与归属拉扯收窄为对离开决定的反思。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S08把“被当作自己人”的归属感泛化为亲近时光，也没有明确区分怀念与想回头。\",\n    \"S09把冲突改写成舍不得以前的生活还是想有人陪，弱化了为了找回归属感而可能重新忍受委屈这一尊严冲突。\",\n    \"S13把对特定亲密关系和归属的怀念泛化为对未来不再孤单的期待，削弱了旧日生活与归属的具体性。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X更完整地保留了旧日自在、被当作自己人、有人支撑的怀念，并反复让这些怀念与不愿再受委屈、坚持独立生活的行动发生碰撞。Y虽然也保留了两股力量，但多处把归属感转化成一般性的陪伴需求和孤独感，使主线略微偏向对陪伴的渴望，而不是尊严与旧日归属之间的持续拉扯。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1b7aade5-7f48-4f1f-9a7b-0be35a9128e4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T093437847562Z", "elapsed_seconds": 20.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:34:58.542536+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ed7cb8e6251fd336d9fd9b080ab010e513915fa009097fcdc16ecf421cc6414e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool